      "conditions": "The Hom-over-field and Hom-over-point finiteness lemmas need a finite morphism and an arbitrary field, not etaleness or a separably closed field. FiniteEtale X is the full subcategory of Over X selected by Scheme.finiteEtaleProperty. Actual scheme pullback and geometric fibers are retained; empty covers are allowed. Only the explicit comparison to the small etale site assumes a separably closed field."
